[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450432081","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98696#issuecomment-2450432081","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98696","id":2450432081,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SDqBR","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T17:25:23Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T17:25:23Z","body":"CC @stuartcarnie Who added `os_unfair_lock`","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450432081/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450657536","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98696#issuecomment-2450657536","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98696","id":2450657536,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SEhEA","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T19:24:39Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T19:24:39Z","body":"Thanks for the PR, @mrsaturnsan!\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, this is a private API, which could affect our iOS deployments and possibly result in rejected builds to the App Store.\r\n\r\nFurther, the original post was on Hacker News, and a fellow software engineer whom I trust, [Saagar Jha](https://saagarjha.com) posted [this comment](https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=33157142) about the API, and warns against using it, as it is private for a reason. I have previously spoken to Apple engineers about the `os_unfair_lock` API, and they say it is generally the right approach to replace a spin lock on Apple platforms.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450657536/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450703682","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98696#issuecomment-2450703682","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98696","id":2450703682,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SEsVC","user":{"login":"mrsaturnsan","id":32889818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg5ODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32889818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsaturnsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T19:54:30Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T19:58:26Z","body":"@stuartcarnie \r\n\r\nHi!\r\n\r\nThe API has been made public so it should be fine to use. The API below is for macOS 15, but the PR I submitted will work before 15 as well. I've also submitted an app to the App Store using the API in the PR, and had no problems with review.\r\n\r\nhttps://developer.apple.com/documentation/os/4338226-os_unfair_lock_lock_with_flags","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450703682/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450811876","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98696#issuecomment-2450811876","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98696","id":2450811876,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SFGvk","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T21:03:32Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T21:03:32Z","body":"@mrsaturnsan excellent – if you have used it, and Apple has made the API public in the latest OS, that is certainly an endorsement.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450811876/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450813506","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98696#issuecomment-2450813506","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98696","id":2450813506,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SFHJC","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T21:04:45Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T21:04:45Z","body":"@clayjohn LGTM!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450813506/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450829653","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98696#issuecomment-2450829653","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98696","id":2450829653,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SFLFV","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T21:16:28Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T21:16:28Z","body":"AFAIK we support as far back as MacOS 10.13 and iOS 12.0, would using those older version be a problem with this PR?\r\n\r\nCC @bruvzg ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450829653/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450840044","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98696#issuecomment-2450840044","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98696","id":2450840044,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SFNns","user":{"login":"mrsaturnsan","id":32889818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg5ODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32889818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsaturnsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T21:24:29Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T21:32:19Z","body":"@clayjohn \r\n\r\nUnfortunately, it looks like support on macOS only started with 10.15. I'm not sure what is the oldest version of iOS this would run on, but it would likely be around iOS 13. Maybe we could add in some compile-time flags to check against the minimum OS version a game is expected to run on and enable features based on that. \r\n\r\nHow about checking the build target is macOS arm64, and only enabling changes then? Do you know what the appropriate define to check would be? Perhaps `__arm64__` ?\r\n\r\n`# CPU architecture.\r\n    if env[\"arch\"] == \"arm64\":\r\n        print(\"Building for macOS 11.0+.\")\r\n        env.Append(ASFLAGS=[\"-arch\", \"arm64\", \"-mmacosx-version-min=11.0\"])\r\n        env.Append(CCFLAGS=[\"-arch\", \"arm64\", \"-mmacosx-version-min=11.0\"])\r\n        env.Append(LINKFLAGS=[\"-arch\", \"arm64\", \"-mmacosx-version-min=11.0\"])\r\n    elif env[\"arch\"] == \"x86_64\":\r\n        print(\"Building for macOS 10.13+.\")\r\n        env.Append(ASFLAGS=[\"-arch\", \"x86_64\", \"-mmacosx-version-min=10.13\"])\r\n        env.Append(CCFLAGS=[\"-arch\", \"x86_64\", \"-mmacosx-version-min=10.13\"])\r\n        env.Append(LINKFLAGS=[\"-arch\", \"x86_64\", \"-mmacosx-version-min=10.13\"])`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450840044/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450858012","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98696#issuecomment-2450858012","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98696","id":2450858012,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SFSAc","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T21:39:02Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T21:39:02Z","body":"> AFAIK we support as far back as MacOS 10.13 and iOS 12.0, would using those older version be a problem with this PR?\r\n\r\nWe do, supporting both probably can be done using `if (__builtin_available(macOS 15, iOS 18, *)) { ... }` (since it's only public since macOS 15 / iOS 18, it probably should be limited to these versions).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450858012/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450862989","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98696#issuecomment-2450862989","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98696","id":2450862989,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SFTON","user":{"login":"mrsaturnsan","id":32889818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg5ODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32889818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsaturnsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T21:43:23Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T21:44:27Z","body":"The problem with `if (__builtin_available(macOS 15, iOS 18, *)) { ... }` is that it's a runtime check so using the new function will cause compile errors when targeting older OS versions. The PR function will work starting macOS 10.15, and it also passed Apple's review since that API was made non-private.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450862989/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450868553","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98696#issuecomment-2450868553","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98696","id":2450868553,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SFUlJ","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T21:48:20Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T21:48:20Z","body":"> The problem with if (__builtin_available(macOS 15, iOS 18, *)) { ... } is that it's a runtime check so using the new function will cause compile errors when targeting older OS versions. \r\n\r\nUsually compiling with old compiler is not important, we only want to support running on old OSes. And we already have `@available` check for macOS 13.4 and iOS 16. But I guess if it's tested on 10.15, `available` check can be 10.15 as well (not sure which iOS versions are supported).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450868553/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450872980","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98696#issuecomment-2450872980","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98696","id":2450872980,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SFVqU","user":{"login":"mrsaturnsan","id":32889818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg5ODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32889818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsaturnsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T21:52:23Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T21:52:23Z","body":"I added #if checks to limit the change to only Arm64 Macs since `-mmacosx-version-min=11.0` is being set for them. I think this would be the safest option. What do you think? :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450872980/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2450874439","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98696#issuecomment-2450874439","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98696","id":2450874439,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SFWBH","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.gi