ctions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2461496348","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98696#issuecomment-2461496348","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98696","id":2461496348,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6St3Qc","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-07T07:22:23Z","updated_at":"2024-11-07T07:22:23Z","body":"Some time ago, I added a benchmark that works as an indirect test of `SpinLock`: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-benchmarks/pull/95. I've used it in my own non-Mac spin-lock improvement PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/85167.\r\n\r\nIt'd be amazing if we could get some numbers from a test based on that (maybe with different amounts of threads) with the following `SpinLock` implementations, on some ARM-based Mac or iPhone:\r\n- Current without Apple-specific implementation.\r\n- The same, from #85167.\r\n- Apple-specific before this PR.\r\n- Apple-specific after this PR.\r\n\r\nI know it's a lot to ask, so if we could at least compare before'n'after this PR on MacOS, that'd be enough here.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2461496348/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2462176736","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98696#issuecomment-2462176736","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98696","id":2462176736,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SwdXg","user":{"login":"mrsaturnsan","id":32889818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg5ODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32889818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsaturnsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-07T12:58:11Z","updated_at":"2024-11-07T12:58:11Z","body":"Sure, I can take a look at the benchmarks.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godo